---
import introVideo from '../assets/intro.webm';
---

<section
	class="relative flex min-h-svh items-end overflow-hidden px-[clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem)] pt-[calc(3.75rem+clamp(0.75rem,2vw,1.5rem)+env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))] pb-[max(clamp(1.5rem,5vw,6rem),env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))] lg:pt-[calc(4rem+clamp(0.75rem,2vw,1.5rem)+env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))]"
>
	<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
		<video
			class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_35%] sm:object-center"
			autoplay
			muted
			loop
			playsinline
			src={introVideo}
		/>
		<div
			class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-base via-base/80 to-base/30 md:via-base/70 md:to-base/20"
		>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl">
		<p
			class="mb-[clamp(0.75rem,2vw,1rem)] text-[clamp(0.75rem,0.65rem+0.35vw,0.875rem)] leading-snug tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"
		>
			<span class="text-accent">Aeria Trois</span>
			<span class="text-muted"> · España y Madrid</span>
		</p>

		<h1
			class="max-w-[min(100%,52rem)] text-[clamp(2.25rem,1.5rem+9.375vw,9rem)] leading-[0.92] text-balance text-foreground"
		>
			Espectáculos<br />
			<span class="text-accent">aéreos</span>
		</h1>

		<p
			class="mt-[clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.5rem)] max-w-xl text-[clamp(1rem,0.925rem+0.35vw,1.25rem)] leading-relaxed text-muted lg:max-w-[38rem]"
		>
			Contrata espectáculos aéreos profesionales con telas aéreas, aro aéreo y acrobacias de alto
			impacto. Creamos números personalizados para festivales, galas corporativas y eventos privados.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-[clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.5rem)] flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:gap-4">
			<a
				href="#contacto"
				class="inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-[clamp(0.875rem,0.825rem+0.2vw,0.9375rem)] font-medium text-base transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 sm:w-auto [@media(pointer:coarse)]:min-h-12 [@media(pointer:coarse)]:px-7"
			>
				Solicitar Presupuesto
			</a>
			<a
				href="#experiencias"
				class="inline-flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-border px-6 py-3 text-[clamp(0.875rem,0.825rem+0.2vw,0.9375rem)] text-muted-soft transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent sm:w-auto [@media(pointer:coarse)]:min-h-12 [@media(pointer:coarse)]:px-7"
			>
				Ver Experiencias
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
